@startuml F0.1-e-conta-bloqueada
title F0.1-e — Login 401 — conta bloqueada
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "LoginUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Usuario -> WebApp: tentativa / Entrar
WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/login
AuthController -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario
Postgres --> UC: usuario (bloqueado_ate > agora)

note right of UC
  estaBloqueado = true
  Resposta idêntica a F0.1-c
  RN-F0.1-08
end note

UC -> Postgres: INSERT audit_log (iam.login_failed)
UC --> AuthController: CredenciaisInvalidasException
AuthController --> WebApp: 401 Problem Details\n(detail genérico)
WebApp --> Usuario: AlertBanner danger\n(sem revelar bloqueio)

@enduml
